  "name": "Vigitel-PNS landline non-coverage bias pipeline",
  "description": "Reproducible R pipeline quantifying the landline non-coverage bias of Brazil's Vigitel telephone surveillance system against the PNS 2019, partitioning the prevalence gap into a non-coverage component and a residual, and simulating five sampling-frame scenarios under the ADEMP framework.",
